:鞭の痕.jpg\n・濡れた陰門が太ももを滴り落\n・肛門にコルヌを挿入する (参考:コルヌ1.jpg&コルヌ2.jpg)\n・ロインクロス付き --> 参考：LC.jpg (色：白) \n・いばらの冠付き --> 参考：いばらの冠.jpg  \n・陰毛--> 参考：ゼノビア.png\n・表情 \n・キャラクターは傾いてはいけません\n\n小説の挿絵のような使い方でPixiv/SNS掲載することもあります。\nよろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1imQbNjk429YuOzOpYOsntUkLG0m8AQJt?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@azyapa/works/101", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/62e619b5/uploads/origins/c06116d2-ab9b-4996-859a-df8441b71573?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=33605b736840f0f7f21675e7679cdb42", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/62e619b5/uploads/origins/c06116d2-ab9b-4996-859a-df8441b71573?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=33605b736840f0f7f21675e7679cdb42, https://si.imgix.net/62e619b5/uploads/origins/c06116d2-ab9b-4996-859a-df8441b71573?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2ef5b9465b368ea1017ebdbfdab58a1a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/62e619b5/uploads/origins/c06116d2-ab9b-4996-859a-df8441b71573?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9860a3d82577f192196befe015889e2b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@azyapa/works/100", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/022d2291/uploads/origins/8a513280-53a0-4bc6-9aa6-80c6f5766f0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=60441238e33fa1de31d2eb6024c87dd6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/022d2291/uploads/origins/8a513280-53a0-4bc6-9aa6-80c6f5766f0e